window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Who knew a dating game would be so dangerous?</b><br> <br> With the murder attempts behind us, I just want to focus on getting to know these bachelors. Fun not forever, lust not love. That’s my motto, and I plan on sticking to it.<br> <br> Until some of these males start sneaking their way into my heart. A tiger, a dragon, an angel—who can keep them all straight? Then there’s my ex’s twin. He has no right to be anywhere near my stupid, fragile heart that suddenly starts beating wildly whenever he’s around.<br> <br> As if dealing with jealous and possessive alpha males isn’t bad enough, another attack sends everyone at the villa on a tailspin. It’s time for the truth about these bachelors to come out before we have another dead body on our hands.<br> <br> Then on to the family visits!</p> <p><b>Continue this steamy and thrilling enemies to lovers, new adult paranormal romance full of tension, mystery, and intrigue in one human-ish woman’s search for true love ♥</b></p> <p><i>***Author's note: Wicked Games is an ADULT dark paranormal romance with some dark themes, possessive males, and adult language. It was originally published on Kindle Vella as Hitched Live. It is set within the world of Azar, along with (in reading order) Hitched, Darkblood Academy, Royally Hitched, Darkblood Prison, Wolfish, Vampish and Of Gods and Wolves, but it's not necessary to read the other series first to enjoy this one.</i></p>"; 
